<title>USA: WMX Technologies sets 50 mln share buyback.</title>
<headline>WMX Technologies sets 50 mln share buyback.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>WMX Technologies Inc said Tuesday its board had approved a two-year program to buy back 50 million shares, and that it would accelerate the move with an Dutch auction of about $1 billion.</p>
<p>The company said the shares represent about 10 percent of its outstanding stock.</p>
<p>Additionally, the company said its Weelabrator Technologies subsidiary would also increase its stock repurchase program to 30 million shares, including a $350 million Dutch auction.</p>
<p>The company said both auctions are targeted for early in the second quarter.</p>
</text>
